# unknowntweaks - whitelist ignore.
#
# Everything is ignored unless it is listed below, so a stray note, screenshot, scratch script,
# editor folder or assistant config can never be committed by accident, whatever it is called.
# To ship a new kind of file, add a "!" line for it here; that edit is the review.
#
# unknowntweaks.ps1 is generated by Compile.ps1 but is committed on purpose: the install
# one-liner downloads it from the repository, and the build workflow rebuilds and commits it.

*
!*/

# ---- sources ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/*.yml
!LICENSE
!README.md
!Compile.ps1
!unknowntweaks.ps1
!config/
!config/*.json
!docs/
!docs/DECISIONS.md
!docs/PUBLISHING.md
!docs/TESTING.md
!functions/
!functions/private/
!functions/private/*.ps1
!functions/public/
!functions/public/*.ps1
!scripts/
!scripts/*.ps1
!tools/
!tools/*.ps1
!xaml/
!xaml/*.xaml
!gate/
!gate/worker.js
!gate/wrangler.toml
!gate/README.md

# ---- never, even inside an allowed folder ----------------------------------------------------
# assistant / editor context
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*
.windsurf*
.copilot*
.continue/
.codeium/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules
MEMORY.md
memory/
*.local.json
# scratch, notes, captures
*.txt
*.png
*.jpg
*.gif
*.zip
*.bak
*.orig
*.swp
*.tmp
*.log
# runtime output the tool itself writes
backup/
logs/
dist/
# OS and editor
__MACOSX/
._*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/

# ---- the one exception to the image rules above -----------------------------------------------
# The app icon is a source file, not a screenshot: the exe is built from the .ico and the window
# carries a copy of it. Both are regenerated from the .png by tools/New-UTIcon.ps1.
!assets/
!assets/icon.png
!assets/icon.ico
